  "title": "Lemon Cranberry Whole Wheat Muffins",
  "description": "These zingy whole wheat muffins, with flax seed and a touch of applesauce, make a tasty breakfast or snack for days when you're on-the-go.",
  "authors": [
    "Patricia Foreman"
  ],
